  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Ruby**: back after 77 archived shows (368 days) [3]\n- **Doin Things Right**: rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **Stone Walls & Steel Bars**: rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n- **No More To Leave you Behind**: back after 119 archived shows (540 days); rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n- **Will You Be Lovin Another Man**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Livin Like An Animal**: earliest performance in the archive; mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Nutshell**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **Libby Phillips**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- Earliest performances in the archive: Cabin Song [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2023-03-18.Flac** (recommended): source not stated; 24 songs; 155 min [1]\n- **billystrings2023-03-18.16-44_AKG451B_BerlinerCM33**: source not stated; 25 songs; 155 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Notes flag a Last Train to Clarksville tease at track 2 and a Fork in the Road tease at track 3 [2]\n- Track 5 is marked as FTP, credited to Alice In Chains [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2023-03-18.Flac**: taped by Jim Mal; transferred by Jim Mal; source: Schoeps MK41V's & Telefunkin M60's > SD 833 [1]\n- **billystrings2023-03-18.16-44_AKG451B_BerlinerCM33**: taped by Mott77; transferred by Mott77; source: AKG C451B & Berliner CM33 > Sound Devices MixPre6 II (32F-48) [2]. Also: Recording label lists AKG 451B and Berliner CM33 microphones as the taping gear, with a 16:44 timestamp [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-03-18 Brady Center Cincy Gold Foil - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-03-18-brady-center-cincy-gold-foil/) [4]\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-03-16 Brady Center Cincy Lava Foil - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-03-16-brady-center-cincy-lava-foil/) [5]\n- Fan art by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings 2023-03-16 Brady Center Cincy Regular - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/merch/2023-03-16-brady-center-cincy-regular/) [6]",
